<div class="container my-5">
    <h1>Optional Robot Expansion</h1>
    <p>We provide the REV FTC Starter Kit v3.1 to new teams. This kit will allow your team to build a robot and compete 
        in the FTC competition. Teams may fundraise money to purchase additional components for your robot. 
        Fundraising and budget is a component of the engineering portfolio. We recommend teams fundraise money 
        to expand the capabilities of their robot and for team spirit through materials like team shirts.
        Below are some example kits to help expand your robot's capabilities.
    </p>

    <div class="table-responsive-lg">
        <table class="table">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th scope="col"></th>
                    <th scope="col">Name</th>
                    <th scope="col">Description</th>
                    <th scope="col">Cost</th>
                    <th scope="col">Link</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td><img style="max-width: 200px;" <%-IMAGE("ftc/robot_kits/mecanum_drivetrain.webp")%> /></td>
                    <td>Mecanum Drivetrain Kit V2</td>
                    <td>This kit provides your team with an aditional motors and mechanical components to build a different drivetrain for your robot.</td>
                    <td>$634.50</td>
                    <td><a target="_blank" href="https://revrobotics.ca/rev-45-2470/" class="btn text-white bg-ftc-orange"> REV Robotics Canada <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><img style="max-width: 200px;" <%-IMAGE("ftc/robot_kits/extrusion_lift_kit.webp")%> /></td>
                    <td>15mm Extrusion Lift Kit</td>
                    <td>This kit contains mechanical components to be able to build a 3-stage <a target="_blank" href="https://docs.revrobotics.com/duo-build/linear-motion-kit/three-stage-continuous-lift">continuous</a> or <a target="_blank" href="https://docs.revrobotics.com/duo-build/linear-motion-kit/three-stage-cascading-lift">cascading</a> lift.</td>
                    <td>$170.78</td>
                    <td><a target="_blank" href="https://revrobotics.ca/rev-45-1900/" class="btn text-white bg-ftc-orange"> REV Robotics Canada <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><img style="max-width: 200px;" <%-IMAGE("ftc/robot_kits/sensor_kit.webp")%> /></td>
                    <td>FTC Sensor Bundle</td>
